<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ankush | Personal Website</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  background: #080812;
  color: white;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

header {
  padding: 25px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #29243c;
}

.logo {
  color: #ad8aff;
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

nav a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 12px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 85vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #30205c, #080812 70%);
}

.hero p {
  color: #ad8aff;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(40px, 9vw, 75px);
  margin: 25px 0;
}

.hero span {
  color: #ad8aff;
}

.hero h3 {
  color: #aaa;
  font-weight: normal;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 30px;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  background: #8955ee;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
}

section {
  padding: 75px 8%;
  text-align: center;
}

h2 {
  color: #ad8aff;
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.about {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: #bbb;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}

.card {
  background: #171727;
  padding: 28px 15px;
  border: 1px solid #393052;
  border-radius: 15px;
  transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  border-color: #ad8aff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px #8955ee55;
}

.card h3 {
  color: #c5adff;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.social a {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 8px;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  background: #171727;
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border: 1px solid #393052;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

footer {
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #888;
  border-top: 1px solid #29243c;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">ANKUSH.</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#hobbies">Hobbies</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
  <p>WELCOME TO MY WORLD</p>
  <h1>HEY, I'M <span>ANKUSH.</span></h1>
  <h3>Multi-Talented | Creative | Tech Lover</h3>
  <a href="#about" class="btn">Explore My World ↗</a>
</div>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Me</h2>
  <p class="about">
    Just a guy with random thoughts, big dreams
    and multiple talents. I love technology,
    gaming, creativity and exploring new things.
    Always curious, always learning and always
    trying something new.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="hobbies">
  <h2>My Hobbies & Interests</h2>

  <div class="cards">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎮 Gaming</h3>
      <p>Gaming and exploring new adventures.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>💻 Technology</h3>
      <p>Exploring tech, computers and gadgets.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎬 Content Creation</h3>
      <p>Creating videos and digital content.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>⛏️ Minecraft</h3>
      <p>Building worlds and enjoying survival.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎨 Creativity</h3>
      <p>Designing and trying creative projects.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🚀 Learning</h3>
      <p>Learning new skills and discovering ideas.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="socials">
  <h2>Find Me Online</h2>
  <div class="social">
    <a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank">Instagram</a>
    <a href="https://youtube.com/" target="_blank">YouTube</a>
    <a href="https://discord.com/" target="_blank">Discord</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 ANKUSH. Made with creativity.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
